{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Peck peck peck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pecking through endless dirt and uncover new underground biomes. Each layer brings new materials, weird characters, and strange surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Excuse Me, One Gear Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With monsters ruling the surface, everyone from brave adventurers to clueless peasants comes descending to your underground smithy. One wants heavy armor, another insists on something enchanted and oddly specific. You can\u2019t exactly say no, so you\u2019d better dig up the goods and hammer out whatever bizarre equipment they\u2019re asking for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Birdsmithing 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock recipes and forge questionable equipment to meet their demands. Craft a <strong>Tater Jerkin</strong> out of potatoes for crunchy fried protection\u2026 but will it actually help them survive long enough to share the loot?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Upgrades &amp; Cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned pigeon profits on upgrades and cosmetics. Improve your digging speed, unlock new perks, and make your pigeon the fanciest underground birdsmith around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is dirt and shinies. Discover odd encounters and make choices that leads to rewards or disasters. Do you peck open the mysterious box or leave it be? Do you rescue the goblin stuck under a boulder\u2026 or pretend you didn\u2019t see him?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle in the corner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peckers is designed to be your quirky corner companion. Dig, craft, and play at your own pace while it happily runs in the corner of your screen. Collapse, resize, or move it anywhere you need.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060780?t=1760797959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/f85097a5a5fa215d6ae86cebc996dee90da32959/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760797959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/d7542ceb92cf5098dbe52122b9946c159cec26ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760797959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/d7542ceb92cf5098dbe52122b9946c159cec26ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760797959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Peck peck peck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pecking through endless dirt and uncover new underground biomes. Each layer brings new materials, weird characters, and strange surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/664f2bb54fd114af92c807a06db26939.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Excuse Me, One Gear Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/318b81c6ca71ce8384718bb0198d3a27.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/58b673c9a7de1a6c527e186f841d23fe.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With monsters ruling the surface, everyone from brave adventurers to clueless peasants comes descending to your underground smithy. One wants heavy armor, another insists on something enchanted and oddly specific. You can\u2019t exactly say no, so you\u2019d better dig up the goods and hammer out whatever bizarre equipment they\u2019re asking for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Birdsmithing 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock recipes and forge questionable equipment to meet their demands. Craft a <strong>Tater Jerkin</strong> out of potatoes for crunchy fried protection\u2026 but will it actually help them survive long enough to share the loot?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Upgrades &amp; Cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned pigeon profits on upgrades and cosmetics. Improve your digging speed, unlock new perks, and make your pigeon the fanciest underground birdsmith around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is dirt and shinies. Discover odd encounters and make choices that leads to rewards or disasters. Do you peck open the mysterious box or leave it be? Do you rescue the goblin stuck under a boulder\u2026 or pretend you didn\u2019t see him?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle in the corner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.poster.avif?t=1760797959\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.webm?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/22149ad2794a7ec9a6280c620bd5ed54.mp4?t=1760797959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peckers is designed to be your quirky corner companion. Dig, craft, and play at your own pace while it happily runs in the corner of your screen. Collapse, resize, or move it anywhere you need.</p>","developers":["Humblebright Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/1a7b70677d4358a57c74124dad8eb6435b749e2d/header.jpg?t=1760797959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Peckers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st